    the next turn after this card resolves, you cannot Special Summon from the Extra
    Deck, except Synchro Monsters. You can banish this card from your GY; immediately
    after this effect resolves, Synchro Summon 1 Synchro Monster. You can only activate
    1 "Synchro Emergency" per turn.
